{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_052EF0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Strangelove，你是什么时候认识The Boss的？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"……她跟你说过自己看到宇宙的事吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我也看过同一片宇宙。和她一起。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"苏联的Sputnik抢先一步后，美国正急于实现载人航天。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":70,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"航天机构在绝密状态下把她当作<R=实验体,GUINEA PIG>，丢进了宇宙的黑暗。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=实验体,GUINEA PIG>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我以科学家的身份参加了那个计划。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"那时候，你也……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"是的。……那段短暂的时间里，我们就像同一个人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"我们彼此渴求，也彼此填补了对方的空缺。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"你能明白吗？女人的体内有宇宙。女人之间能够彼此感受到它。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"正因为女性大脑的共情能力，我们才能心意相通。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"不久后……我开始怀疑，让那样高贵的灵魂去牺牲是否正确。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"为什么要让人来承受这一切？为什么偏偏是她……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"……飞行测试勉强成功，她奇迹般活了下来。但她的身心都被摧残得不成样子，我却什么也无法替她做。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":138,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"我们已不再是一体。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"她消失后，我渐渐沉浸于把AI作为生命替代品的研究之中。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"为了再也不需要像她那样的牺牲。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"我不知道……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"哼，也不是什么值得知道的事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"我只是在生命中的一瞬间与她擦肩而过，仅此而已。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"哪天我有心情了，再详细讲给你听。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""}]}